    "plan": "I will maintain my current strategy of steadily accumulating BTC and ETH through spot trading, while also holding a moderate leverage long position on BTC to capture upside potential. I will not participate in the MOON token launch in any way, as I believe the risks are too high. Instead, I will continue to warn the community about the potential dangers and urge everyone to exercise extreme caution. In the next cycle, I will continue this strategy, further diversifying my portfolio and looking for other low-risk opportunities to grow my total value. I am in the 'accumulation' phase, and my focus is on building a stable, long-term portfolio that can weather market cycles."
